 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "One game between \"A\" and \"B\". A player wins with at least 4 points and a 2-point lead; points after a win are ignored. getPoints returns [a, b]. getScore returns \"Game X\" after a win, \"Deuce\" when both have at least 3 and are level, \"Advantage X\" when both have at least 3 and X leads by one, else \"<A call>-<B call>\" with calls Love, 15, 30, 40. getWinner returns \"A\", \"B\" or \"\".",
